     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<p>Structured data from this resource. The JSON and XML tabs provide the complete FHIR representation.</p>\n<table class=\"grid\"><caption>Structured DiagnosticReport data</caption><tbody>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Resource ID</th><td>9d3d7489-9293-423a-5393-8685872728b4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Metadata and profiles</th><td>\n\n\n<p><b>Profile:</b> http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/StructureDefinition/us-core-diagnosticreport-note</p>\n\n\n\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Status</th><td>Final<br/></td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Categories</th><td><span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 34117-2}, {http://loinc.org 51847-2}\">History and physical note</span><br/></td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Report type</th><td><span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 34117-2}, {http://loinc.org 51847-2}\">History and physical note</span><br/></td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Subject</th><td><a href=\"Bundle-teran-breast-cancer-r4-clean.html#urn-uuid-324d4f70-205b-60cc-a081-24b98a0f139e\">Julia Julia Terán (official) Female, DoB: 1942-11-30 ( https://github.com/synthetichealth/synthea#324d4f70-205b-60cc-a081-24b98a0f139e)</a><br/></td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Encounter</th><td><a href=\"Bundle-teran-breast-cancer-r4-clean.html#urn-uuid-324d4f70-205b-60cc-65ac-50e059411094\">Encounter: identifier = https://github.com/synthetichealth/synthea#324d4f70-205b-60cc-65ac-50e059411094 (use: official, ); status = finished; class = ambulatory (ActCode#AMB); type = Postoperative follow-up visit (procedure); period = 2019-03-17 16:33:52-0500 --&gt; 2019-03-17 17:06:12-0500; reasonCode = Malignant neoplasm of breast (disorder)</a><br/></td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Effective time</th><td>2019-03-17 16:33:52-0500<br/></td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Issued</th><td>2019-03-17 16:33:52-0500<br/></td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Performers</th><td><code>Dr. Bertram Pyle</code><br/></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>Attachments</h3>\n\n<table class=\"grid\"><tbody>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Content type</th><td>text/plain; charset=utf-8<br/></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n\n<pre><code>\n2019-03-17\n\n# Chief Complaint\nNo complaints.\n\n# History of Present Illness\nJulia241 Julia241 is a 76 year-old hispanic white female.\n\n# Social History\nPatient is single. Patient quit smoking at age 16.\n Patient identifies as heterosexual.\n\nPatient comes from a middle socioeconomic background.\n Patient has completed some college courses.\nPatient currently has Medicare.\n\n# Allergies\nNo Known Allergies.\n\n# Medications\nNo Active Medications.\n\n# Assessment and Plan\n\n\n\n## Plan\n\nThe following procedures were conducted:\n- physical examination, complete (procedure)\n</code></pre>\n\n\n\n</div>"
